Hint: Use Raoult's law
∵ For liquid solution of two liquids ‘1’ and ‘2’
\(\begin{aligned} & \mathrm{P}_1=\mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{T}}
\mathrm{y}_1=\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}} \mathrm{x}_1 \\ & \therefore
\frac{\mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{T}}}{\mathrm{x}_1}=\frac{\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{y}_1}
\\ & \therefore
\frac{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}+\mathrm{x}_1\left(\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}-\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}\right)}{\mathrm{x}_1}=\frac{\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{y}_1}
\\ & \therefore
\frac{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{x}_1}+\left(\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}-\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}\right)=\frac{\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{y}_1}
\\ & \therefore
\frac{1}{\mathrm{x}_1}=\left(\frac{\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}}\right)\left(\frac{1}{\mathrm{y}_1}\right)+\left(\frac{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}-\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}}\right)
\\ & \therefore \text { Slope
}=\left(\frac{\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}}\right) \\ &
\therefore \text { Intercept
}=\left(\frac{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}-\mathrm{P}_1^{\mathrm{o}}}{\mathrm{P}_2^{\mathrm{o}}}\right)
\end{aligned}\)<div style="margin-top:1.25rem; padding:0.85rem 1rem; background:var(--bg-secondary); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;"><div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.6rem; font-weight:600; font-size:0.88rem;"><span>📊 Student Attempt Analytics</span><span style="padding:2px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color:#d97706;">🟡 Medium · 51% Got This Correct</span></div><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem;"><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12); border:1.5px solid #22c55e;"><div style="color:#16a34a; font-weight:700;">(1) ✓</div><div style="font-weight:800; color:#16a34a; margin-top:2px;">51%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(2)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">23%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(3)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">15%</div></div><div style="padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);"><div>(4)</div><div style="font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;">13%</div></div></div></div>

